quest.android_conversion.text=So you want to give up flesh for steel? I can do it... if you bring me 1 Nanochip, 2 Evolitium Crystals and 3 Iron Ingots.
quest.android_conversion.dialog_1=Androids never run out of ki. Never. But there is no going back.
quest.android_conversion.dialog_2=I need a Nanochip for the brain, Evolitium Crystals for the core, and iron for the frame.
